{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-19-1","title":"Revelation 19:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God is praised in heaven for judging the great whore, and avenging the blood of his saints. 7 The marriage of the Lamb. 10 The angel will not be worshipped. 17 The fowls called to the great slaughter.</p>\n<p>after. 18:1-24 I heard. 11:15; 18:20 Alleluia. 3,4,6; Ps 106:1; 111:1; 115:18; 146:1; 148:1; 149:1; 150:1; *marg: Salvation. 4:10,11; 5:9-13; 7:10-12; 11:15; 12:10; 1Ch 29:11; Ps 3:8; Jon 2:9 Mt 6:13; 1Ti 1:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-2","title":"Revelation 19:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>true. 15:3; 16:5-7; De 32:4; Ps 19:9; Isa 25:1 judged. 17:1,2,15,16; 18:3,9,10,23 and hath. 6:10; 18:20,24; De 32:35,43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-3","title":"Revelation 19:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Alleluia. 1 And her. 14:11; 18:9,18; Ge 19:28; Isa 34:10; Jude 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-4","title":"Revelation 19:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the four. 4:4-10; 5:8-11,14; 11:15,16; 15:7 Amen. 5:14; 1Ch 16:36; Ne 5:13; 8:6; Ps 41:13; 72:19; 89:52; 106:48 Jer 28:6; Mt 6:13; 28:20; 1Co 14:16 Alleluia. 1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-5","title":"Revelation 19:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>a voice. 7:15; 11:19; 16:17 Praise. Ps 103:20-22; 134:1; 135:1,19,20; 148:11-13; 150:6 both. 11:18; 20:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-6","title":"Revelation 19:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>and as the voice of many. 1:15; 14:2; Eze 1:24; 43:2 and as the voice of mighty. 4:5; 6:1; 8:5; 14:2; 19:6; Job 40:9; Ps 29:3-9; 77:18 for. 11:15-18; 12:10; 21:22; Ps 47:2,7; 93:1; 97:1,12; 99:1; Isa 52:7 Mt 6:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-7","title":"Revelation 19:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>be glad. De 32:43; 1Sa 2:1; Ps 9:14; 48:11; 95:1-3; 100:1,2; 107:42; Pr 29:2 Isa 66:10,14; Zec 9:9; Joh 3:29; Php 3:3 for. 21:2,9; Ps 45:10-16; So 3:11; Isa 62:5; Ho 2:19,20; Mt 22:2 Mt 25:1-10; 2Co 11:2; Eph 5:32 and his. Isa 52:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-8","title":"Revelation 19:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>to her. 3:4,5,18; Ps 45:13,14; Isa 61:10; Eze 16:10; Mt 22:12; Ro 3:22 Ro 13:14; Eph 5:26,27 white. or, bright. Mt 17:2; Mr 9:3; Lu 24:4; Ac 1:10 the fine. 7:13,14; Ps 132:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-9","title":"Revelation 19:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Write. 1:19; 2:1,8,12,18; 3:1,7,14; 10:4; 14:13; Isa 8:1; Hab 2:2 Blessed. 7,8; 3:20; Mt 22:2-4; Lu 14:15,16 These. 11; 21:5; 22:6; 1Ti 1:15; 4:9; 2Ti 2:11; Tit 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-10","title":"Revelation 19:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I fell. 22:8,9; Mr 5:22; 7:25; Ac 10:25,26; 14:11-15; 1Jo 5:21 See. 2Co 8:7; Eph 5:15,33; 1Th 5:15; Heb 12:25 I am. Ps 103:20,21; Da 7:10; Lu 1:19; Heb 1:14 the testimony. 1:9; 12:11,17; 22:9; 1Jo 5:10 worship. 4:10; 14:7; 15:4; Ex 34:14; 2Ki 17:36; Ps 45:11; Mt 4:10; Joh 4:22-24 Php 3:3 for the. Lu 24:25-27,44; Joh 5:39; Ac 3:12-18; 10:43; 13:27; Ro 3:21,22 1Pe 1:10-12; 2Pe 1:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-11","title":"Revelation 19:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>heaven. 4:1; 11:19; 15:5 a white. 6:2; Zec 1:8 Faithful. 1:5; 3:7,14; Joh 14:6 and in. 15:3-7; Ps 45:3-7; 50:6; 72:2-4; 96:13; 98:9; 99:4; Isa 11:3-5; 32:1 Isa 45:21; 63:1-5; Jer 23:5,6; 33:15; Zec 9:9,10; Heb 7:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-12","title":"Revelation 19:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>eyes. 1:14; 2:18 on his. 6:2; 12:3; 13:1; Ps 8:5; So 3:11; Isa 62:3; Zec 9:16; Mt 21:5; 28:18 Heb 2:9 a name. 16; 2:17; 3:12; Ge 32:29; Ex 23:21; Jud 13:18; Isa 9:6; Mt 11:27 Lu 10:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-13","title":"Revelation 19:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>clothed. 14:20; Ps 58:10; Isa 9:5; 34:3-8; 63:1-6 The. Joh 1:1,14; 1Jo 1:1; 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-14","title":"Revelation 19:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the armies. 14:1,20; 17:14; Ps 68:17; 149:6-9; Zec 14:5; Mt 26:53; 2Th 1:7 Jude 1:14 white horse. 11 clothed. 8; 4:4; 7:9; Mt 28:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-15","title":"Revelation 19:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>out. 21; 1:16; 2:12,16; Isa 11:4; 30:33; 2Th 2:8 and he shall. 2:27; 12:5; Ps 2:9 and he treadeth. 14:17-20; Isa 63:2-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-16","title":"Revelation 19:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>on his vesture. 12,13 KING. 17:14; Ps 72:11; Pr 8:15,16; Da 2:47; Php 2:9-11; 1Ti 6:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-17","title":"Revelation 19:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>an angel. 8:13; 14:6; Isa 34:1-8 saying. 21; Isa 56:9; Jer 12:9; Eze 39:17-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-18","title":"Revelation 19:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>ye. De 28:26; 1Sa 17:44,46; Ps 110:5,6; Jer 7:33; 16:4; 19:7; 34:20 Eze 29:5; 39:18-20; Mt 24:28; Lu 17:37 of all. 6:15; 13:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-19","title":"Revelation 19:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I saw. 13:1-10; 14:9; 16:14,16; 17:12-14; 18:9; Eze 38:8-18; Da 7:21-26 Da 8:25; 11:40-45; Joe 3:9-14 him. 11-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-20","title":"Revelation 19:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the beast. 19; 13:1-8,18; 17:3-8,12; Da 2:40-45; 7:7,12-14,19-21,23 the false. 13:11-17; 16:13,14; 20:10; 22:15; Da 7:8-11,24-26; 8:24,26 2Th 2:8-11 These. 20:10,14; Da 7:11; 11:45 burning. 14:10; 21:8; Ge 19:24; De 29:23; Job 18:15; Ps 11:6; Isa 30:33; 34:9 Eze 38:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-19-21","title":"Revelation 19:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":19,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":19,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the remnant. 11-15; 1:16 and all. 17,18; 17:16</p>"}]}